<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 14-15.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 14-15.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>14-15. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 14-15	 May 13-14</p>
<p> CZK	0.44069	    0.44504</p>
<p> DKK	2.10126	    2.10106</p>
<p> FIM	2.65441	    2.65193</p>
<p> HUF	0.07524	    0.07516</p>
<p> JPY	0.11483	    0.11407</p>
<p> LTL	3.40935	    3.39575</p>
<p> LVL     23.78576	   23.68673</p>
<p> RUR	0.00237	    0.00236</p>
<p> SEK	1.77708	    1.176916</p>
<p> UAH	7.3817	     7.3682</p>
<p> USD     13.634	     13.5796</p>
<p> XEU     15.59798	   15.56765</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
